      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Enough... enough... don't start again.\n\nKumaran:\n\nO speaking yaazh, doe-eyed maiden,\nYou are the breeze that blows.\n\nMeenu:\n\nO blue sky, can you forget yourself\nAnd praise the moon?\n\nKumaran:\n\nO beauty! Tamil epic,\nAn unpainted painting—\n\nMeenu:\n\nSpeaking words of delight again and again,\nCasting loving glances again and again.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "This immutable dialogue record owns part of `naam-perf-002`; the English performance link is attached here so the printed span is not duplicated in a separate song unit."
        ],
