      "translation": {
        "english_text": "If I am the yaazh, then you are surely its music.\n\nKumaran:\n\nThere are differences within music;\nWe need none between us.\n\nBoth:\n\nA life of love is the juice of ripe fruit,\nThe delight of women and valiant men.",
